	(text "Pin map: PA0-PA3 SERVO1-4 (TIM2 CH1-4) | PA4 VBAT_SENSE (ADC) | PA6/PA7 MOTOR_IN1/2 (TIM3 CH1/2)\nPB0/PB1 LIGHT1/2 (TIM3 CH3/4) | PB6-PB8 RC_IN1-3 (TIM4 CH1-3, 5 V tolerant) | PA9/PA10 USART1\nPB10/PB11 I2C2 (IMU + Qwiic) | PB12/PB13 IMU INT1/INT2 | PC13 user LED (low-active)\nHSE 8 MHz, C_L = 12 pF: C = 2*(12 pF - 4 pF) = 16 pF -> 15 pF C0G. LSE optional (DNP)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
